WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:06.540
[The American Cancer Society presents]

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:12.820
[The Traitor Within / In Technicolor]

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:18.860
[A John Sutherland Production]

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:26.080
[Direction...George Gordon, Story... Norm Wright,
Music... Paul Smith, Art Direction... Bernice Polifka, 

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:30.460
Animation...Pete Burness, Irven Spence, Elmer Watson

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:46.480
[Narrator:] Every three minutes someone dies
of cancer. Day after day, week after week,

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:54.960
month after month, cancer kills close to 200,000
of our people each year.

00:00:55.159 --> 00:01:02.159
Yet more than one-third of these deaths can
be prevented. Fear, ignorance, superstition

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:05.280
are responsible for these needless casualties.

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:12.040
[Woman 1:] My dear, what a terrible disgrace,
they say she died of cancer.

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:17.100
[Woman 2:] I'm just sure that she caught it
from that old Mrs. So-and-so. Cancer germs

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:18.590
were all over the place.

00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:25.450
[Man 1:] Once you get cancer, that's all brother,
you're through, that's one thing that can't

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:26.000
be cured.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.100
[Woman 3:] A friend of mine told me about
a new medicine for cancer, just wonderful,

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.710
you don't have to have an operation.

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:39.070
[Man 2:] Everybody knows it's inherited; none
of my folks had cancer, so I don't have to

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:39.830
worry.

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:46.660
[Narrator:] Don't be a sucker, everyone's
chances of developing cancer are just about

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:52.000
the same regardless of heredity. We all have
to be on guard.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.190
No case of cancer has ever been cured by patent
medicine, salves, paste, ointments or other

00:01:58.190 --> 00:02:05.190
quack treatment. Cancer is no more of a disgrace
than pneumonia or any other disease.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:12.640
Cancer is not contagious. Many people are
being cured of cancer every day. Now, to study

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:19.910
cancer's effect on the human body, let's assume
that our organs are like group of interrelated

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:21.970
factories.

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:25.970
Raw materials are brought to the factories
by the blood stream which travels through

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:31.640
the arteries. Waste products are carried away
by the veins, lymph canals.

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:38.640
The cells of the body may be thought of as
workers in these factories. These cells work

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:47.790
smoothly along on their routine job of keeping
the body alive and healthy. Occasionally a

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:56.030
cell dies.

00:02:56.030 --> 00:03:00.200
[ Music ]

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:07.200
When this happens, a healthy cell merely divides
itself to fill the gap.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:13.700
[ Music ]

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:18.950
When the gaps are filled by new cells the
division stops, and the cells go on with their

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:25.430
work. This is normal cell behavior and most
people live out their lives in this untroubled

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:28.310
fashion.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:36.470
Once in a while, something goes wrong with
the normal cell and cancer originates.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:45.820
 A healthy, normal cell turns into a malignant cancer
cell.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:54.270
[ Music ]

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:59.980
It steals food from the normal cell.

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:09.380
[ Music ]

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:16.380
Dividing and multiplying relentlessly, cancer
cells crowd out the active worker.

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:32.260
[ Music ] [Large black cancer cells are shown killing healthy cells and dividing into additional malignant cells.]

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:43.020
Since cancer starts with one cell, it can be
cured if it is treated while it is still in

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:51.380
its original place, by removal through simple
surgery.

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:58.939
[ Music ]

00:04:58.939 --> 00:05:05.939
By radiation from x-ray tubes.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:14.249
[ Music ] [Black, malignant cells are shown being zapped by bolts of radiation.]

00:05:14.249 --> 00:05:21.249
By rays emanating from radium.

00:05:21.809 --> 00:05:27.620
[ Music ]

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:34.620
When every single cancer cell is removed by
surgery or destroyed by x-ray or radium, the

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:42.180
patient is cured, if cancer is not destroyed
when it is localized here's what happens.

00:05:44.139 --> 00:05:51.069
This small cancer growth in the breast is neglected.
Now we're in trouble. The cancer cells have

00:05:51.069 --> 00:05:56.659
escaped from their original location and are
getting into the lymph canal, although in

00:05:56.659 --> 00:06:01.279
some cases cancer cells travel through the
bloodstream as well.

00:06:01.279 --> 00:06:07.839
The malignant horde is on its way to invade
other parts of the body. The invading horde

00:06:07.839 --> 00:06:14.839
reaches the lymph nodes under the armpit. 
This is the last chance because when the cancer

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:21.409
cells escape from this lymph node, they move
from the armpit to the point at the base of

00:06:21.409 --> 00:06:26.020
the neck where the lymph pours into the bloodstream.

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:31.729
Now they are pumped by heart action to the
lungs where many new cancers develop. The

00:06:31.729 --> 00:06:36.599
blood then carries some of the cancer cells
from the lungs back to the heart which pumps

00:06:36.599 --> 00:06:40.909
them out through the arteries to all parts
of the body.

00:06:40.909 --> 00:06:47.909
When the neglected cancer has spread throughout
the body, there is no hope for cure.

00:06:49.499 --> 00:06:53.379
[ Music ]

00:06:53.379 --> 00:07:00.379
Fortunately many cancers can be cured if recognized
and treated in time. So look out for these

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:04.419
danger signals.

00:07:04.419 --> 00:07:11.279
Any sore that does not heal, particularly
about the tongue, mouth or lips.

00:07:11.279 --> 00:07:18.279
A painless lump or thickening, especially in
the breasts, lips or tongue, irregular bleeding

00:07:19.339 --> 00:07:25.809
or discharge from any natural body opening,
progressive change in the color or size of

00:07:25.809 --> 00:07:29.610
a wart, mole or birthmark.

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:39.170
Persistent indigestion, persistent hoarseness,
unexplained cough or difficulty in swallowing,

00:07:40.259 --> 00:07:44.330
any change in normal bowel habits.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:51.210
Pain is seldom a symptom of early cancer,
so don't forget these danger signals. Any

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:56.210
sore that does not heal, particularly about
the tongue, mouth, or lips.

00:07:56.210 --> 00:08:03.180
A painless lump or thickening, especially in
the breasts, lips, or tongue. Irregular bleeding

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:06.860
or discharge from any natural body opening.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:12.809
Progressive change in the color or the size
of a wart, mole or birthmark. Persistent indigestion,

00:08:12.809 --> 00:08:19.419
persistent hoarseness, unexplained cough or
difficulty in swallowing. Any change in the

00:08:19.419 --> 00:08:22.210
normal bowel habits.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:33.230
At the first symptom, go to your doctor. If
necessary he will send you to a hospital for

00:08:33.419 --> 00:08:38.370
a more complete examination than he can give
in his office.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:45.089
Here at the hospital a highly trained team
will serve you. This team includes a physician

00:08:45.089 --> 00:08:50.750
who has special knowledge of the microscopic
appearance of cancer tissue.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:56.279
This pathologist will be able to tell your
doctor whether the growth you have is actually

00:08:56.279 --> 00:09:05.419
cancer. If it is, early treatment can save
your life for yourself and loved ones.

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:13.200
[ Music ]

00:09:13.209 --> 00:09:22.369
You must save yourself.  Remember the danger
signals. Go to your doctor at the first symptom.

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:29.740
Cancer must be stopped before it gets away.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:32.260
[ Music ]

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:39.360
[The End]

